{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-density","title":"def:smooth-density","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":2054,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:smooth-density","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:density-vector-space]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:smooth-density","line":3300,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Smooth Density]\n\\label{def:smooth-density}\n\n\\uses{def:density-vector-space}\n\n\n\n\nA \\emph{smooth density} on a smooth $n$-manifold assigns a density $\\mu_x$ to each $T_xM$ such that $x\\mapsto\\mu_x(Y_1|_x,\\ldots,Y_n|_x)$ is smooth for every smooth local frame $(Y_i)$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Smooth Density] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a736d6f6f74682d64656e73697479\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Adensity-vector-space\">↗ def:density-vector-space</a> <p></p>A <em>smooth density</em> on a smooth <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>-manifold assigns a density <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mu _x$\">$\\mu _x$</span> to each <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_xM$\">$T_xM$</span> such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x\\mapsto \\mu _x(Y_1|_x,\\ldots ,Y_n|_x)$\">$x\\mapsto \\mu _x(Y_1|_x,\\ldots ,Y_n|_x)$</span> is smooth for every smooth local frame <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(Y_i)$\">$(Y_i)$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blue